          "inspector_px": 1622,
          "inspector_cap_px": 520,
          "inspector_floor_px": 320,
          "verdict": "above the cap"
        }
      ],
      "method": "grim captures of the mapped window, with the vertical edges read from the pixels: the rail's border at 189/190px and the splitter at 914/920px.",
      "note": "The list pane is 724px in both cases: the layout does not depend on the width the window actually has."
